<decision #implement-windows-sandbox-dual-account.dual-vs-single apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "decided"
  owner = "track"
}
(
  <question ?>每次命令可选网络策略用双账号还是单账号+动态 WFP？</?>
  <options { } [
    <option { key = "A" recommended = true }
    (
      <title ?>dual-account</?>
      <description ?>双账号（online/offline），runner 按 --network 选账号</?>
    )
    >
    <option { key = "B" }
    (
      <title ?>single-dynamic</?>
      <description ?>单账号 + 每次命令动态装/卸 WFP</?>
    )
    >
    <option { key = "C" }
    (
      <title ?>single-fixed</?>
      <description ?>单账号一次性（现状，不可每次选）</?>
    )
    >
  ]>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>A。双账号是 独立账号模式，WFP 只需对 offline 装一次，runner 按 --network 选账号即可，简单可靠。</?>
      <decision-text ?>A。双账号是 独立账号模式，WFP 只需对 offline 装一次，runner 按 --network 选账号即可，简单可靠。</?>
      <rationale ?>动态装/卸 WFP 每次有延迟且有竞态；双账号隔离清晰，--network 直接映射账号。</?>
      <evidence ?>旧决策记录中的用户答复、最终决策与实施理由。</?>
  )
  >
)
>
<decision #implement-windows-sandbox-dual-account.legacy-cleanup apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" {
  status = "decided"
  owner = "track"
}
(
  <question ?>旧单账号 eidolon-sandbox 如何处理？</?>
  <options { } [
    <option { key = "A" recommended = true }
    (
      <title ?>cleanup</?>
      <description ?>setup 双账号后删除旧单账号</?>
    )
    >
    <option { key = "B" }
    (
      <title ?>keep</?>
      <description ?>保留旧账号不清理</?>
    )
    >
  ]>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>A。setup 双账号后删除旧 eidolon-sandbox，避免混淆。</?>
    <decision-text ?>A。setup 双账号后删除旧 eidolon-sandbox，避免混淆。</?>
    <rationale ?>旧账号是单账号设计的产物，双账号后无用途，清理避免误用。</?>
    <evidence ?>结论文：A。setup 双账号后删除旧 eidolon-sandbox，避免混淆。</?>
  )
  >
)
>
